    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_4",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "\"My Sentimental Friend\" is a song written by Geoff Stephens and John Carter and performed by the Herman's Hermits. It reached #2 in the United Kingdom and Ireland, #3 in Australia, and #6 in New Zealand in 1969.",
